ision to them. They laugh at every stronghold, for they build up an earthen ramp and take it."},{"verse":11,"text":"Then they sweep by like the wind and go on. They are indeed guilty, whose strength is their god.”"},{"verse":12,"text":"Aren’t you from everlasting, LORD my God, my Holy One? We will not die. LORD, you have appointed them for judgment. You, Rock, have established him to punish."},{"verse":13,"text":"You who have purer eyes than to see evil, and who cannot look on perversity, why do you tolerate those who deal treacherously and keep silent when the wicked swallows up the man who is more righteous than he,"},{"verse":14,"text":"and make men like the fish of the sea, like the creeping things that have no ruler over them?"},{"verse":15,"text":"He takes up all of them with the hook. He catches them in his net and gathers them in his dragnet. Therefore he rejoices and is glad."},{"verse":16,"text":"Therefore he sacrifices to his net and burns incense to his dragnet, because by them his life is luxurious and his food is good."},{"verse":17,"text":"Will he therefore continually empty his net, and kill the nations without mercy?"}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/habakkuk.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]},{"id":"habakkuk_2","bookSlug":"habakkuk","chapter":2,"reference":"Habakkuk 2","title":"Habakkuk 2 — Public Domain Study","topics":["habakkuk","habakkuk","ot","scripture","哈巴谷書","哈巴谷书","耶和華回答哈巴谷","耶和华回答哈巴谷"],"snippet":{"zh-CN":"我要站在守望所， 立在望楼上观看， 看耶和华对我说什么话， 我可用什么话向他诉冤。"},"tokens":{"20":2,"35":1,"habakkuk":9,"public":2,"domain":2,"study":1,"ot":1,"scripture":1,"哈巴谷書":1,"哈巴谷书":2,"耶和華回答哈巴谷":1,"耶和华回答哈巴谷":1,"我要站在守望所":1,"立在望楼上观看":1,"看耶和华对我说什么话":1,"我可用什么话向他诉冤":1,"他对我说":1,"将这默示明明地写在版上":1,"使读的人容易读":1,"因为这默示有一定的日期":1,"快要应验":1,"并不虚谎":1,"虽然迟延":1,"还要等候":1,"因为必然临到":1,"不再迟延":1,"迦勒底人自高自大":1,"心不正直":1,"惟义人因信得生":1,"迦勒底人因酒诡诈":1,"狂傲":2,"不住在家中":1,"扩充心欲":1,"好像阴间":1,"他如死不能知足":1,"聚集万国":1,"堆积万民都归自己":1,"这些国的民岂不都要提起诗歌并俗语讥刺他说":1,"祸哉":2,"迦勒底人":1,"你增添不属自己的财物":1,"多多取人的当头":1,